stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Development: model register (artifacts + config + metrics)
    Development --> Validation: validation_passed = true
    Development --> Archived
    Validation --> Staging: PR-AUC >= 0.50
    Validation --> Development
    Validation --> Archived
    Staging --> Production: validation_passed & PR-AUC >= 0.50 (archives prior Prod)
    Staging --> Validation
    Staging --> Archived
    Production --> Archived: replaced or rollback
    Archived --> Production: rollback (latest archived restored)
